\section{FINAL WORDS}
\label{final}

%In summary, we have presented the approaches to testing and verification of monolithic interferometric assembly, the \textit{vingel}, designed to meet the demanding requirements of high-precision coordinate positioning. These compact OEM modules in both two-axis and three-axis configurations offer a scalable solution for advanced motion platforms. Notably, the system operates with a single He-Ne laser feed, simplifying integration while achieving sub-nanometer resolution and the $10^{-7}$ dynamic range.

