Due to variation in correlation structures over time, the number of selected drivers may change across rebalancing dates. As a result, hyperparameter 1 is dynamically linked to thresholds \( T_1 \) and \( T_0 \). %Further discussion on practical implementation choices and the selection of HSP configurations is provided in Section \textit{Management Insights}.


