Here $k_0$ is an arbitrary constant.
\end{subequations}
It is interesting to note that acting $R[w]$ on $w_x$ does not result in a 7th-order symmetry for
(\ref{5th-EQ-w}). Instead, $R[w]$ maps the $x$-translation symmetry to itself, i.e.,
\begin{gather}
