Now $\max(h_n - \ell_n, h_{(m-1) \otimes n}) = (h_n - \ell_n) \mathds 1_{A} + h_{(m-1) \otimes n} \mathds 1_{A^c}$ where $A = \{h_{(m-1) \otimes n} \le h_n - \ell_n\}$ (where the left and right hand side are independent). Now (let $n$ be large enough)
\begin{align*}
