    &\to 0
\end{align*}
It follows $\E \mathds 1_A = \P(A) \to 0$ so that $\Var \mathds 1_A = \P(A)(1 - \P(A)) \to 0$ and hence $\mathds 1_A \to_p 0$, so that also $(h_n - \ell_n)/\log n \cdot \mathds 1_A \to_p 0$. Hence we have the bound
