% their period distribution is similar to the overall variable population (Fig.~\ref{fig:twinsperiods}).
This group contains all 21 stars flagged in {\tt SIMBAD} as Carbon stars with $14.5<g<15$ mag (see Table~\ref{tab:cands}).
