%(Fig.~\ref{fig:twinslopes}).  
As noted earlier, they tend to be modestly
more luminous than both randomly selected variable stars in that part of the CMD (Fig.~\ref{fig:twins}).
%and known L/SR/ROT variables in that region  (Fig.~\ref{fig:twincmd}). 
