%Applied to rolling windows of financial returns from the USA, India and Hong Kong economies, this approach addresses the limitations of traditional models that rely on parametric assumptions. By accounting for asymmetry, heavy tails, and cross-correlated asset prices, the proposed method offers a robust solution for optimizing diverse portfolios in an interconnected financial markets.

\end{abstract}


