	The precise definition of causal frugal information settings that we consider is as follows
	\begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*)]
		\item \textbf{fresh gradient setting:} At time $t,$ to choose $x_t,$ \ALG can use $\left\{ f_i(x_{i-1}), \nabla f_i(x_{i-1}) \mid i = 1, 2, \ldots, t \right\}.$ \label{setting:fresh-grad}
