		\item \textbf{noisy gradient setting:} Let $\nabla f^{\text{rec}}_t$ be the approximate estimate of $\nabla f_t(x_{t-1})$ with error at most $\alpha$ i.e. $|\nabla f^{\text{rec}}_t-\nabla f_t(x_{t-1})| \leq \alpha.$
