\section*{Conclusions}
%
To sum up this article, we will highlight its main position: \\[12pt]
%
Alexey Zinovievich Petrov is an outstanding geometer and theoretical physicist of the second half of the 20th century, one of a small number of stars of the Soviet Union's gravitational theorists, and certainly the second brightest (after Lobachevsky) star of the Kazan geometric school. I am sure that time will confirm this assessment.


